step Night Elves: Darnassus to Stormwind
  only NightElf
  zone Darkshore
  tip Portal down to Rut'theran Village, boat to Auberdine, then the Stormwind boat from the same pier.
  note Druids: Cure Poison at 14, Aquatic Form at 16 and Cat Form at 20 come from class quests (Polestar guides, Class).
  getfp "Auberdine"

step Stormwind: meeting point
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Group XP: keep the whole group within 4 levels. Ahead? Play class quests or professions solo, not zone quests.
  getfp "Stormwind"
  task "Group up with your friends"
